  "body_html": "<p>Inspire dreams of the field with this Jeminise Soccer Player Comforter Set, perfect for young soccer enthusiasts. This personalized bedding set features vibrant soccer designs, making it an ideal addition to any boy's room and a thoughtful gift for a soccer fan.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Soccer Enthusiasm:</strong> Designed for young soccer fans, inspiring them with their favorite sport and soccer stars.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name and number, creating a unique bedding set for your child.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Features a hidden zipper and smooth metal pull for effortless duvet insertion and removal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Environmentally friendly finishing process ensures fabric retains dye and prevents fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover, with options for pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Soccer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>A4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Full</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Width</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
